#   - LeadingEdge_Down_Symbols (new)
#
# Conversion rules:
#   * One symbol per Ensembl ID (first non-empty, distinct).
#   * IDs with no symbol are left as the original Ensembl ID (gene is NOT
#     dropped), so the symbol list aligns position-for-position with the
#     Ensembl list and the up/down sets stay complete.
# =============================================================================

